{
  "comment": "matches.json (automatch.mjs) pairs each item with a skin by comparing its icon with the skins. An automatic match is kept if score >= minScore, or score >= fallbackScore with margin over the runner-up >= fallbackMargin (spot checks, 2026-10-15: >= 0.75 about 15/16 right; 0.65-0.75 about half, but nearly all right with a margin >= 0.15). 'skins' are matches checked by hand, which always win; 'exclude' are items left out. Wings (Ailes, type 300) were all checked by eye on 2026-10-15: the 36 right ones are in skins, the 10 wrong ones in exclude. Shoulder pads (type 299) and costumes (type 199) were all checked by eye on 2026-10-16: 104 shoulder pads and 19 neck pieces kept. automatch.mjs leaves full-body costumes out, so their torso (Abdomen, Torse, Cou composed as in build-catalogue.mjs) was compared with the icons separately, and the 36 right torso pieces, full-body costumes included, were added to skins on 2026-10-16 (only their torso is shown). Belts, shoes, sleeves and doubtful matches excluded. Living items (objets vivants, type 113): each look (level) of a living hat is matched on its own icon, keyed \"itemId:level\" (matches-vivants.json); checked by eye on 2026-10-16: 92 looks kept, those that replace the whole head (Monstrivan, Cass'Noisettan…) or are only recolourable pieces (Colorivant…) excluded. Doubtful hat and cape matches (below the thresholds, 520 items) were all checked by eye on 2026-10-17 against the 3/4 hat views and back-rendered capes: 116 hats and 226 capes were right (often the 2nd-4th candidate) and are in skins; the 106 hats and 72 capes that were wrong or unclear are in exclude.",
